### ─── PropertyLoop Agents Endpoints ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Login as agent
# @name loginAgent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{agentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{agentPassword}}"
}

### Login as buyer (for reviews)
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{buyerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{buyerPassword}}"
}

### ═══ 1. List agents (public) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents?page=1&limit=10

### ═══ 2. List agents with filters ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents?search=chioma&sort=top_rated&limit=10

### ═══ 3. Get own profile (agent) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 4. Update own agent profile ═══
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/agents/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chioma Okafor",
  "bio": "Specialist in luxury Lekki and VI properties with 10+ years experience",
  "yearsExperience": 10,
  "specialty": ["Buy", "Rent", "Shortlet"],
  "website": "https://primerealtylagos.com"
}

### ═══ 5. Get agent dashboard stats ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/me/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAgent.response.body.accessToken}}

### ═══ 6. Get public agent profile ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{loginAgent.response.body.user.id}}

### ═══ 7. List agent reviews ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{loginAgent.response.body.user.id}}/reviews

### ═══ 8. Create agent review (as buyer) ═══
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{loginAgent.response.body.user.id}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Chioma was incredibly helpful and transparent throughout the entire process. Highly recommended!"
}

### ═══ 9. Verify review appears ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{loginAgent.response.body.user.id}}/reviews

### ═══ 10. Buyer trying to access agent endpoint (expect 403) ═══
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.accessToken}}
